# Video.js v10

> The open-source video player for React and HTML. Lightweight, accessible components built for performance and streaming.

> AI coding agents can install the [Video.js skill](https://github.com/videojs/skills) to find version-matched documentation and follow current Video.js 10 patterns.

> The `video.js` package on npm is still Video.js 8. Video.js 10 ships as `@videojs/react` and `@videojs/html`.

> Print version-matched installation options without changing files: `npx @videojs/cli agents init`. Installation guide index: https://videojs.org/docs/guides/installation.md

